# =============================================================================
# packages.d/wine.pacman — no repo packages: the whole wine stack (standalone
# wine-staging runner, winetricks, yabridge, yabridgectl) is installed by
# run_once_02-wine-staging.sh.tmpl, so that it follows the component switch.
#
# This file exists so that "wine" is a known component (one .pacman file per
# component is the registry rule); it is listed here only as documentation.
#
# Component: wine — off by default.
# =============================================================================
